  "body": "基于 [Mihon v0.20.4](https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon/releases/tag/v0.20.4) 的非官方 HarmonyOS / 卓易通 兼容构建 (preview 构建类型)。\n\n## 本构建包含的补丁\n\n- `0001-downloads-rename-fallback-for-saf-without-renamedocument.patch`: downloads: fall back to copy+delete when SAF renameDocument is unsupported\n- `0002-updater-use-harmony-fork-releases.patch`: updater: check this fork's GitHub releases for -harmony-preview builds\n- `0003-downloads-cbz-temp-in-private-cache.patch`: downloads: keep CBZ temp files in the private cache, tolerate stale archives\n- `0004-database-busy-timeout-and-room-like-connection-setup.patch`: database: busy timeout and Room-like connection setup to avoid \"database is locked\"\n- `0005-downloads-background-keep-alive-silent-audio.patch`: downloads: keep the process alive in the background on HarmonyOS (silent audio + wake lock)\n- `0006-downloads-notification-speed-and-progress.patch`: downloads: Animeko-style progress notification with speed and progress\n- `0007-updater-delete-installed-apk.patch`: updater: delete the installed update APK at startup\n- `0008-updater-release-mirror.patch`: updater: read the release list from the repo-branch mirror first\n- `0009-build-flexible-adapter-from-maven-central.patch`: build: resolve FlexibleAdapter from Maven Central instead of JitPack\n- `0010-downloads-finalize-with-fewer-saf-copies-and-error-reasons.patch`: downloads: finish chapters with fewer SAF copies and show why a download failed\n\n## 安装说明\n\n- 下载 `mihon-v0.20.4-harmony-preview.9-arm64-v8a.apk`（华为设备均为 arm64）。\n- 包名为 `app.mihon.debug`，与官方正式版 `app.mihon` 是两个独立应用，可以共存；harmony-preview 版本之间可直接覆盖安装。\n- 设置 → 高级 → 扩展安装器 选「Private」，扩展会装进 App 自己的目录，不再受卓易通安装限制。\n- 应用内更新会检查本仓库的 Release，而不是官方更新服务器。\n- 建议开启 设置 → 下载 →「保存为 CBZ」：目录模式下下载中的图片会被鸿蒙图库索引。\n\n## 校验 (SHA-256)\n\n```\n05b937b3b4797f45c668ae06671847693e7a2963355717b842bdc033dd5d24e2  mihon-v0.20.4-harmony-preview.9-arm64-v8a.apk\n8fd9c7e7dfb735c0647f8f73ec65d55e9685c7c4297b8b7f2af90179fe059de9  mihon-v0.20.4-harmony-preview.9-universal.apk\n```\n"
